SCOPE

The MIT terms above cover only the code written for this site:

  - the HTML, CSS and JavaScript of the pages in this repository
  - the browser-based save viewers, editors and data browsers
  - the build, audit and helper scripts

They do NOT cover:

  - Files under files/ — community tools and patches from 1998-2008, each the
    work of its original author. They are preserved here for historical access
    with attribution; their authors retain all rights.
  - Guide text contributed by community authors, credited on the pages that
    carry it. Reuse should credit the original author.
  - Any material belonging to the games themselves — artwork, music, story
    text, manuals or guidebooks. None of that is published here, and no rights
    to it are granted by this licence.

Factual data (item and monster names, numeric values, file-format observations)
is not copyrightable and may be reused freely; crediting the source is
appreciated. See legal/terms.html for the full breakdown.
